# hugmesh-go-live-reconcile — web-UI go-live effector convergence timer (60s).
#
# The TIMER half of the go-live wizard's fourth (web-UI) interface leg (the
# OpenRC service runs the agent once at boot; this cron entry re-runs it every
# 60s). cronie reads /etc/cron.d (the same mechanism provision.sh uses for
# hugmesh-device-registry-sync + hugmesh-domain-reconcile + hugmesh-vpn-reconcile).
# Installed on every fleet node (core, not an optional-service gate).
#
# The agent is FAIL-CLOSED + idempotent: a failed fetch/verify keeps the
# last-good cache + applies nothing; a successful one drives the canonical
# `hugmesh-go-live commit`/`rollback` subcommands ONLY on an actual state
# transition for THIS node's own cluster domain. The authoritative fast path
# for CLI/ncurses/Studio operators is the driver itself (immediate, interactive);
# this pull is the convergence path for a web-UI-recorded intent / missed pushes
# / reboots.
#
# Field order: min hour dom month dow user command
* * * * * root /usr/sbin/hugmesh-go-live-reconcile >> /var/log/hugmesh-go-live-reconcile.log 2>&1
